{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Earth is our home planet. It is a place where people, animals, and plants can live.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.44,0.57],[0.64,0.82],[0.93,1.26],[1.31,1.89],[2.14,2.28],[2.33,2.43],[2.48,2.51],[2.59,2.94],[2.96,3.19],[3.27,3.82],[3.92,4.59],[4.63,4.78],[4.92,5.36],[5.42,5.61],[5.69,6.36]]},{"text":"Earth has air all around it. We breathe this air to live and grow.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.43,0.61],[0.71,0.99],[1.07,1.29],[1.37,1.71],[1.78,2.07],[2.39,2.55],[2.63,3.01],[3.06,3.25],[3.34,3.61],[3.69,3.79],[3.87,4.08],[4.12,4.19],[4.26,5.06]]},{"text":"The air around Earth is called the atmosphere. It wraps Earth like a blanket.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.31,0.61],[0.71,1.15],[1.24,1.54],[1.61,1.74],[1.85,2.19],[2.22,2.31],[2.39,3.27],[3.66,3.83],[3.9,4.3],[4.38,4.66],[4.72,4.95],[4.99,5.02],[5.08,6.13]]},{"text":"The atmosphere helps keep Earth warm. It holds in heat from the Sun.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.92],[0.99,1.3],[1.37,1.6],[1.74,2.03],[2.11,2.66],[3.04,3.2],[3.27,3.62],[3.68,3.77],[3.88,4.17],[4.24,4.43],[4.49,4.56],[4.63,5.43]]},{"text":"The atmosphere also protects Earth. It helps burn up many small space rocks.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.29,0.92],[0.97,1.25],[1.32,1.82],[1.9,2.31],[2.6,2.76],[2.83,3.13],[3.22,3.52],[3.58,3.7],[3.79,4.05],[4.11,4.47],[4.54,4.96],[5.02,5.8]]},{"text":"Some space rocks are called asteroids. Most stay far away from Earth.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.36,0.85],[0.91,1.24],[1.29,1.43],[1.49,1.82],[1.92,2.8],[3.25,3.56],[3.59,3.88],[3.98,4.26],[4.33,4.61],[4.68,4.89],[5.03,5.76]]},{"text":"Scientists watch space carefully. They track asteroids to help keep Earth safe.","words":[[0,0.71],[0.78,1.07],[1.14,1.63],[1.68,2.42],[2.71,2.91],[2.98,3.33],[3.42,4.1],[4.14,4.21],[4.31,4.54],[4.62,4.87],[4.96,5.25],[5.34,6.18]]},{"text":"Earth has water, air, and the right warmth. These things help life grow.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.65],[0.79,1.41],[1.49,1.89],[1.94,2.16],[2.23,2.3],[2.37,2.68],[2.75,3.4],[3.79,4.11],[4.18,4.56],[4.64,4.92],[5.03,5.33],[5.4,6.18]]},{"text":"That is why Earth is special. It is a safe place for living things to call home.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.34,0.45],[0.52,0.8],[0.94,1.24],[1.31,1.42],[1.47,2.19],[2.52,2.67],[2.73,2.83],[2.89,2.94],[3.02,3.37],[3.44,3.79],[3.84,3.99],[4.08,4.37],[4.45,4.75],[4.79,4.87],[4.96,5.2],[5.29,6.04]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: Earth protects us, and we can help protect Earth too.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.31,0.97],[1,1.11],[1.21,1.87],[2.19,2.51],[2.58,3.06],[3.13,3.48],[3.69,3.88],[3.94,4.03],[4.09,4.25],[4.33,4.59],[4.67,5.11],[5.18,5.45],[5.51,6.18]]}]}